    {
      "source": "Store the given error information in the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/server/ServerWebExchange.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>ServerWebExchange</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的错误信息存储在当前的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/server/ServerWebExchange.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>ServerWebExchange</code></a> 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the underlying cause of the error or <code>null</code> if the error cannot be\nextracted.",
      "translation": "返回错误的根本原因，如果无法提取错误则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of the error attributes. The map can be used as the model of\nan error page, or returned as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/reactive/function/server/ServerResponse.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.function.server\"><code>ServerResponse</code></a> body.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含错误属性的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>。该 map 可用作错误页面的模型，或作为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/reactive/function/server/ServerResponse.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.function.server\"><code>ServerResponse</code></a> 的 body 返回。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of the error attributes.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含错误属性的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides access to error attributes which can be logged or presented to the user.",
